%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: a Separation stroke. The stroking colour space and colour
% are set from the same page resource as the non-stroking ones (`CS`
% and `SCN` beside `cs` and `scn`), so the stroke carries the tint.
[/Separation /Spot /DeviceCMYK {0 0 0 4 -1 roll}] setcolorspace
0.6 setcolor
6 setlinewidth 100 100 moveto 300 100 lineto stroke
showpage
